{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28062","headline":"春园醉醒闲卧小斋 · 杨发","name":"春园醉醒闲卧小斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"酣醉送余春，醒来恨更频。\n花残蜂蠹物，叶暗鸟欺人。\n帘闭高眠贵，斋空浩气新。\n从今北牕蝶，长是梦中身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨发","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28062.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28062","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}